1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:05,800
6:40 AM. The radio room in Brightwall.
Seven people are sleeping on a floor
made for two.

2
00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:12,567
Eleven thousand people have a city.
Seven of us have one blanket and one
rule. Find a better place to sleep.

3
00:00:14,767 --> 00:00:26,533
I picked three bases. A house. A mall.
A skyscraper. Ten days in each. Four
rules decide which one lives. And a
fifth rule decides the vote. I'll tell
you that one at the very end.
